# Project Structure Guide

This repository contains three main projects, each with its own specific structure and requirements.

## Project Organization

Each project follows this structure:
- `client/`: Frontend Next.js application
- `server/`: Backend Express server
- `docs/`: Project documentation
- `tests/`: Test files

### AI Writer Project
The main entry point is [01-ai-writer/client/pages/index.js](mdc:01-ai-writer/client/pages/index.js)
Key components:
- [01-ai-writer/client/components/Editor.js](mdc:01-ai-writer/client/components/Editor.js): Monaco-based text editor
- [01-ai-writer/server/api/generate.js](mdc:01-ai-writer/server/api/generate.js): Text generation endpoint

### Content Summarizer Project
The main entry point is [02-content-summarizer/client/pages/index.js](mdc:02-content-summarizer/client/pages/index.js)
Key components:
- [02-content-summarizer/client/components/URLInput.js](mdc:02-content-summarizer/client/components/URLInput.js): URL processing
- [02-content-summarizer/server/api/summarize.js](mdc:02-content-summarizer/server/api/summarize.js): Content summarization endpoint

### Code Explainer Project
The main entry point is [03-code-explainer/client/pages/index.js](mdc:03-code-explainer/client/pages/index.js)
Key components:
- [03-code-explainer/client/components/CodeEditor.js](mdc:03-code-explainer/client/components/CodeEditor.js): Code input interface
- [03-code-explainer/server/api/analyze.js](mdc:03-code-explainer/server/api/analyze.js): Code analysis endpoint
